    "title": "Probing the Plasticity and Correlation of LLM Value Systems: LLM Value Rankings are Not Stable",
    "citation": "Zhen-Heng Tang et al., 2026",
    "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/41484aa4653813adf48218efeed45a71e028b12e",
    "authors": "Zhen-Heng Tang; Qi-Hua Pan; Jingya Shen; Xiang Liu; Qian Wang; Bo Li; Xiao-Wen Chu",
